      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woe to them that go down to Egypt for help; and stay on horses, and trust in chariots, because",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "many; and in horsemen, because they are very strong; but they look not unto the Holy One of Israel, neither seek the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet he also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wise, and will bring evil, and will not call back his words: but will arise against the house of the evildoers, and against the help of them that work iniquity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the Egyptians",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "men, and not God; and their horses flesh, and not spirit. When the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall stretch out his hand, both he that helpeth shall fall, and he that is holpen shall fall down, and they all shall fail together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus hath the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spoken unto me, Like as the lion and the young lion roaring on his prey, when a multitude of shepherds is called forth against him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will not be afraid of their voice, nor abase himself for the noise of them: so shall the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts come down to fight for mount Zion, and for the hill thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As birds flying, so will the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts defend Jerusalem; defending also he will deliver",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it; and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "passing over he will preserve it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Turn ye unto",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him from",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "whom the children of Israel have deeply revolted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For in that day every man shall cast away his idols of silver, and his idols of gold, which your own hands have made unto you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Then shall the Assyrian fall with the sword, not of a mighty man; and the sword, not of a mean man, shall devour him: but he shall flee from the sword, and his young men shall be discomfited.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall pass over to his strong hold for fear, and his princes shall be afraid of the ensign, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", whose fire",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.31.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in Zion, and his furnace in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
